{"seq":32,"slug":"large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering","title":"大屏、折叠屏与平板适配工程：自适应布局、窗口形态与多设备输入","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering","rating":{"composite":4,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"大屏-折叠屏与平板适配工程-自适应布局-窗口形态与多设备输入-简介\">大屏、折叠屏与平板适配工程：自适应布局、窗口形态与多设备输入 简介</h1><p>本 hub 讨论一个在移动应用工程里长期被低估、却在近五年被硬件形态彻底激活的题目：如何让同一个应用在手机之外的大屏设备上——平板、折叠屏、桌面形态的 Android 与 iPadOS、以及不断分合的可变窗口——都呈现得自然、可读、可操作。它不只是「把布局拉宽」的样式问题，而是一整条从设备版图认知到发布质量治理的工程链路。</p>\n<p>起点是设备与窗口模型的认知。大屏设备已经不是单一尺寸的放大手机：折叠屏有内屏与外屏两种物理形态、有半折叠的中间姿态，平板有横竖屏与分屏多窗口，桌面形态还引入了自由拖拽的窗口与键鼠指针。</p>\n<p>工程师必须先把「屏幕尺寸」「窗口尺寸」「窗口尺寸类」这几个概念区分清楚，理解配置变更如何触发重建、状态如何在其中存活，才能谈自适应。把窗口而非设备当作布局的输入，是本 hub 反复强调的第一原则。</p>\n<p>在有了正确的窗口世界观之后，本 hub 转向自适应布局本身。响应式栅格与断点、可伸缩的间距与排版、流式与约束驱动的布局系统、列表与详情的主从模式、导航规范在各尺寸档位上的取舍——这些是日常工作量最大的部分，也是「看起来能跑」与「真的舒服」之间差距最大的部分。</p>\n<p>内容会强调用规范与模式沉淀决策，而不是在每个页面里重新发明断点。可复用的布局原语与导航骨架，比逐页堆叠媒体查询更能抵抗设备形态的持续变化。</p>\n<p>接着是折叠屏与多窗口这两个大屏特有的深水区。铰链分隔的物理连续性、折叠姿态下的布局重排、应用连续性（在设备折叠或窗口迁移时不丢状态）、多窗口里的拖放与并排协作、以及可调整窗口下的尺寸续接，构成了本 hub 的技术核心。这里的很多问题没有现成标准答案，需要在平台能力、用户预期与实现成本之间做权衡。</p>\n<p>最后一块是多设备输入、测试与发布质量治理。大屏设备天然带键盘、鼠标、手写笔与触控的混合输入，交互状态与焦点模型因此变得复杂；测试要覆盖的不再是几款手机，而是一组形态各异的窗口与姿态；发布则要面对尺寸档位的质量门、兼容性回退与真实设备验证。</p>\n<p>把输入、测试、发布三件事一起讲，是因为它们共享同一件事：把「在某一台设备上试过没问题」变成「在一类设备上都成立」的系统性证据。</p>\n<p>整体脉络从设备版图到布局规范，再到折叠与多窗口的姿态与续接，收束到输入、测试与发布闭环。读完本 hub，读者应当具备一套完整的判断力：面对任意一块新形态的屏幕，知道该先问什么问题、该在哪里做决策、以及如何证明这个决策在大屏上真的成立。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"large-screen-ecosystem-window-model","title":"大屏设备版图、窗口尺寸类与配置变更","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/large-screen-ecosystem-window-model","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"window-size-class-breakpoint-model","title":"窗口尺寸类与断点模型：compact/medium/expanded 的语义与判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/large-screen-ecosystem-window-model/window-size-class-breakpoint-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"configuration-change-state-continuity","title":"配置变更与状态续存：Activity/场景重建、旋转与尺寸变化的处理机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/large-screen-ecosystem-window-model/configuration-change-state-continuity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"device-matrix-formfactor-targeting","title":"设备矩阵与形态分类：平板/折叠/桌面模式的密度、可调整窗口与目标设备清单治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/large-screen-ecosystem-window-model/device-matrix-formfactor-targeting"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"adaptive-layout-navigation-canonical-patterns","title":"自适应布局与导航规范模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/adaptive-layout-navigation-canonical-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"master-detail-list-detail-pattern","title":"主从布局模式：列表-详情（list-detail）与 supporting pane 的结构与选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/adaptive-layout-navigation-canonical-patterns/master-detail-list-detail-pattern"},{"seq":2,"slug":"adaptive-navigation-container-switching","title":"自适应导航容器：导航栏/导航抽屉/底部栏的切换规则与状态保持","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/adaptive-layout-navigation-canonical-patterns/adaptive-navigation-container-switching"},{"seq":3,"slug":"resizable-layout-constraint-exceptions","title":"可调整大小窗口的布局异常：文本重排、最大宽度约束与内容溢出治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/adaptive-layout-navigation-canonical-patterns/resizable-layout-constraint-exceptions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"foldable-posture-multiwindow-continuity","title":"折叠姿态、多窗口与跨窗口协作","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/foldable-posture-multiwindow-continuity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foldable-posture-hinge-model","title":"折叠姿态与铰链模型：half-opened/flat/tabletop 与铰链避让区域","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/foldable-posture-multiwindow-continuity/foldable-posture-hinge-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multiwindow-split-dragdrop-continuity","title":"多窗口与跨窗口续接：分屏、拖放、跨窗口数据传递与协作机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/foldable-posture-multiwindow-continuity/multiwindow-split-dragdrop-continuity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"posture-transition-state-recovery","title":"姿态切换的异常与恢复：折叠展开中断、生命周期错乱与状态重建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/foldable-posture-multiwindow-continuity/posture-transition-state-recovery"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"multi-input-testing-store-quality-ops","title":"多设备输入、测试矩阵与发布质量治理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/multi-input-testing-store-quality-ops","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stylus-keyboard-pointer-input-model","title":"多模态输入模型：手写笔、外接键盘、鼠标与触控的焦点、hover 与快捷键","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/multi-input-testing-store-quality-ops/stylus-keyboard-pointer-input-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"testing-matrix-emulator-automation","title":"多设备测试矩阵：可调整窗口模拟、预览工具与自动化回归验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/multi-input-testing-store-quality-ops/testing-matrix-emulator-automation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"store-large-screen-quality-requirements","title":"大屏质量要求与发布治理：商店审核要点、适配度量与缺陷分级闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/large-screen-foldable-tablet-adaptive-app-engineering/multi-input-testing-store-quality-ops/store-large-screen-quality-requirements"}]}]}